<title>USA: Weekly broiler/egg report -- USDA.</title>
<headline>Weekly broiler/egg report -- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Placements of broiler chicks in the 15 major producing states in the week ended June 14 totalled 141.150 million, versus a revised 141.363 million in the previous week and 134.252 million a year ago, the U.S. Agriculture Department said.</p>
<p>Eggs set in those states in the same week totalled 173.936 million, versus a revised 174.958 million the previous week and 167.768 million in the comparable week of last year, USDA said.</p>
</text>
